            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention relates to an upper comprising: a knitted component, the knitted component comprising: a first knit layer, a second knit layer, and a thermoplastic strand comprising thermoplastic material contained between the first knit layer and the second knit layer, the thermoplastic strand being melted and re-solidified such that the thermoplastic strand penetrates the first knit layer.</p>
